        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 129051),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 133476),
          text:
              'Mohsin and Mohsina were visiting the neighbourhood children with slices of watermelon.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 136189),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 138276),
          text: '“Assalam o Alaikum, Tariq,” Mohsina greeted when she saw him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 138276),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141510),
          text: '“Wa Alaikum Assalam,” he replied quietly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141962),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 144494),
          text: 'Mohsin noticed Tariq’s face immediately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144494),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 149300),
          text:
              '"You look as though someone served you bitter medicine for lunch."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 149755),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 151844),
          text: 'Tariq told them what had happened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 152299),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 156874),
          text:
              'Mohsin picked a watermelon seed from the plate and placed it in Tariq\'s palm.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 156874),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 161362),
          text:
              '"If I put this in the soil today, will it become a vine before Asr?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 162512),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 163892),
          text: 'Tariq almost smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 163892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 165392),
          text: '"No."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 165392),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 168372),
          text: '"Truth can feel slow like that," Mohsin said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 168372),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 173332),
          text: '"A false story may spread quickly because people repeat it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 173332),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 178092),
          text: 'Truth sometimes needs patience, evidence and courage.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 178092),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 180172),
          text: 'But slow does not mean weak."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 180180),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 186180),
          text:
              'When Tariq returned, Imaan and Akhlaaq were still thinking about the footprints.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 186504),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 192180),
          text:
              'Imaan had made a rule for their investigation: they would write only what they knew.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 192857),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 195180),
          text: '"Known," she said, pointing at the page.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 195180),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 197180),
          text: '"The notebook is missing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197180),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 199180),
          text: 'A note was found.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 200148),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 202648),
          text: 'Footprints went from the garden to the office.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 202648),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 205848),
          text: 'One footprint has a crescent-shaped gap."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 206520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 209548),
          text: 'Akhlaaq added another heading: "Not known."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 209548),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 211948),
          text: '“Who wrote the note,” he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 211948),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 214158),
          text: '“Who made the footprints.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 214158),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 216148),
          text: 'Who took the notebook.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 216148),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 220116),
          text:
              'Whether those three things were even done by the same person.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 220116),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 224236),
          text: 'He paused and looked at what he had written.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224236),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 230156),
          text:
              '“And I was about to say the footprints prove the same person wrote the note and took the book.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 230156),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 231796),
          text: 'They do not.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231796),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 234476),
          text: 'I almost said more than we know.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 234989),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 236916),
          text: 'Imaan looked impressed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 236916),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 239516),
          text: '“That last one matters.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 239516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 242884),
          text: 'And correcting your own words matters too.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 242884),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 244444),
          text: '"Of course it matters.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 244444),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 247364),
          text: 'I am an excellent detective."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 247364),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 251884),
          text: '"Yesterday you accused your socks of hiding."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 251884),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 253444),
          text: '"Different case."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 253444),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 257604),
          text: 'That afternoon, Sheikh Uncle searched his office again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 257604),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 263767),
          text:
              'Near the bottom drawer, he found the blue thread they had noticed the previous evening.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263767),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 268481),
          text:
              'It was smooth and shiny, not thick like the stitching on most schoolbags.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 269407),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 276652),
          text:
              'He placed it inside a small transparent envelope instead of carrying it around the classroom.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 276652),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279732),
          text: '"A clue should be protected," he explained.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 280020),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282889),
          text: '"Otherwise we may change it without realising."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 283780),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 287650),
          text:
              'Tariq looked at the thread and then at his own blue schoolbag.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 288500),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 291660),
          text: 'One side pocket was badly frayed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 291660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 293420),
          text: 'Several children noticed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 293420),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 297220),
          text: 'A whisper began: "His bag is blue."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 297220),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 299220),
          text: 'Wasim turned around.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 299220),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 300758),
          text: '"Lots of things are blue.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 300758),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 302628),
          text: 'That proves nothing."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 303228),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 304548),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 304548),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 305388),
          text: '"Correct.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 305388),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 307908),
          text: 'A colour is not an identity."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 308329),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 312376),
          text:
              'Imaan quietly compared Tariq\'s bag to the thread from the office.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 312376),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 315154),
          text: 'The bag\'s loose fibres looked rough.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 315154),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 319516),
          text: 'The clue was smooth, almost like ribbon or a lanyard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 319516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 321836),
          text: 'She wrote that down too.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 321836),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 324956),
          text: 'At dismissal, Tariq turned to Wasim.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 326573),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 328596),
          text: '“JazakAllahu Khaira for defending me,” he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 328596),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 331356),
          text: '“You would do the same for me,” Wasim replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 331356),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 335196),
          text: '"You would do the same for me," Wasim replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 335196),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 339924),
          text:
              'As he turned away, his school identity card swung from his neck.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 339924),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 342924),
          text: 'The lanyard was dark blue.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 343539),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 344924),
          text: 'Imaan noticed it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 344924),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 347324),
          text: 'But blue was still only a colour.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 347924),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 350924),
          text: 'She did not say a word.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 350924),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 357924),
          text:
              'That night, beyond the Academy\'s boundary wall, two familiar shadows stood beneath a tree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 358512),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 359892),
          text: 'Haasid\'s voice was low.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 359892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 361892),
          text: '"He is still being trusted."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 362661),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 363892),
          text: 'Kaazib chuckled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 363892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 365892),
          text: '"Trust is useful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 365892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 369892),
          text:
              'The stronger it becomes, the more damage it can do when it breaks."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 369892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 373892),
          text: 'A third figure stood with them, hidden by darkness.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 373892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 379860),
          text:
              'As the figure turned, something blue caught briefly on a rough nail in the wall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 379860),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 382860),
          text: 'A single thread remained behind.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 382860),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 399828),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day - Stop One Rumour',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 399828),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 403437),
          text:
              'If you hear an unverified story about someone today, do not repeat it. If another child asks you what happened, say only what you actually know. If you do not know, use the honest sentence: "I do not know."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 403437),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 411908),
          text:
              'Level-Up: If you have already repeated an unverified story, go back to the person you told and correct it.',
        ),
      ],
