        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 237939),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 240936),
          text: 'He reached down and helped Tariq zip his bag.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 240936),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 244099),
          text: 'His own blue lanyard brushed against the desk.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 245239),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 248389),
          text: 'Akhlaaq noticed that one edge looked slightly fuzzy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 248389),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 252268),
          text: 'He opened his mouth, but Imaan gently tapped his notebook.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 252268),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 253777),
          text: 'Not enough evidence.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 254339),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 256119),
          text: 'Akhlaaq closed his mouth again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 256119),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 260147),
          text: 'Later that day, Sheikh Uncle received a small parcel.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 261027),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 266627),
          text:
              'Two men from a security company came with it and spent nearly an hour near the office corridor.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 267392),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270755),
          text: 'Shahzaib asked if they were installing a secret robot.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270755),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 274755),
          text: '"No secret robots," Sheikh Uncle replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 274755),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279755),
          text:
              'One of the men climbed a ladder and fixed a small black device above the corridor.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 280422),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 281755),
          text: 'Akhlaaq looked at it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 281755),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282862),
          text: '"Smoke detector?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282862),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 289643),
          text:
              '"Something to help us protect the Academy," Sheikh Uncle said, and left it at that.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 289643),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 292483),
          text: 'Most students forgot about it within minutes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 293235),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 294363),
          text: 'Imaan did not.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 294363),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 299723),
          text:
              'At the end of the day, the old note was still locked inside Sheikh Uncle\'s drawer:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 299723),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 301923),
          text: 'THE TRUTH LEAVES FOOTPRINTS.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 301923),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 303523),
          text: 'FOLLOW THEM.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 303523),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 308876),
          text:
              'But now the children understood something the writer of the note might not have expected.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 308876),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 311244),
          text: 'A footprint could lead to a door.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 311244),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 315131),
          text: 'It could not tell you who opened it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 315739),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 319185),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day - Finish the Sentence',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 319185),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 331659),
          text:
              'Think of one situation where you have told only the safe part of the truth. Correct it today. Give the missing detail calmly and without blaming somebody else.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 331659),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 340546),
          text:
              'Level-Up: If your hidden detail caused a problem for someone, take one practical step to repair that harm.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'honesty_en_04',
      title: 'Ep 4 · The Test of Trust',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/honesty.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/honesty/04_the_test_of_trust.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.moral,
      description: 'The Book of Trust — episode 4 of 10.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 113),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1567),
          text: 'CHAPTER 4',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1567),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 4113),
          text: 'The Test of Trust',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 4113),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 10681),
          text: 'Moral Focus: A trust must be protected, not performed',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 10681),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 17201),
          text:
              'Two days later, the Islamiat teacher carried a small wooden donation box into class.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 17201),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 25521),
          text:
              'The Academy\'s charity drive had collected money for several families, and the envelopes inside the box were not to be opened by students.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 26049),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 30009),
          text: '“This is an amanah - a trust,” she explained.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 30009),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 34449),
          text:
              '“It does not belong to us, so we have to protect it carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 34449),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 37681),
          text: 'The donations will reach the families soon, Inn shaa Allah.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 38489),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 43089),
          text:
              'She locked the box and placed the key in the cupboard near her desk.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 43089),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 48877),
          text:
              'Wasim was asked to help carry the box to Sheikh Uncle\'s office after class.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 48877),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 52977),
          text: 'The request earned him another round of approving smiles.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 52977),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 56257),
          text:
              '"You are becoming the Academy\'s official trusted person," Shahzaib announced.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 58394),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 59017),
          text: 'Wasim laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 59017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 61537),
          text: '"Please do not give me a uniform."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 61537),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 63337),
          text: 'The lesson began.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 63337),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 65985),
          text: 'An hour later, the teacher opened the cupboard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 65985),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 67985),
          text: 'The key was gone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 67985),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 70985),
          text: 'The room became tense instantly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 70985),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 75985),
          text: 'A few heads turned toward Tariq before anyone even spoke.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 76699),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 77699),
          text: 'Tariq noticed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 77699),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 78413),
          text: 'So did Imaan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 78985),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 82985),
          text: 'She felt a sudden urge to say, "Stop looking at him."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 82985),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 85985),
          text: 'Instead, she remembered the investigation rule.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 86793),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 88193),
          text: 'Facts first.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 88193),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 89553),
          text: 'The class searched.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 90068),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 94273),
          text:
              'Shahzaib found a small key near the window and lifted it like a trophy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 94273),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 96473),
          text: '"Mystery solved!"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 96473),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 97953),
          text: 'Wasim examined it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 97953),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 102113),
          text: '"No. The donation key had a red mark near the top."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 102113),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 103513),
          text: 'The teacher checked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 103513),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104913),
          text: 'He was right.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 104913),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 105921),
          text: 'They searched again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 105921),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 110581),
          text:
              'This time the real key was found beneath the teacher\'s chair.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 110581),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 114481),
          text: 'It had probably fallen when she opened the cupboard earlier.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 114481),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 115641),
          text: 'Everyone relaxed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 116065),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 120481),
          text:
              'Sheikh Uncle, who had entered during the search, looked around the room.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 120481),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 122161),
          text: '"Notice what almost happened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 122161),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 128253),
          text:
              'A key went missing, and some of you were ready to connect it to the person you already suspected.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 128253),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131089),
          text: 'But the key had not been stolen at all."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 131089),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 133449),
          text: 'He pointed to the recovered key.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 133449),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 136009),
          text: '"Not every missing thing is a crime.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 136009),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 138449),
          text: 'Not every coincidence is a clue."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 138864),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 140609),
          text: 'Imaan wrote that sentence down.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 140609),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 144009),
          text: 'Wasim received praise for remembering the red mark.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144009),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 149177),
          text:
              'He lowered his eyes modestly and said he had only been paying attention.',
