          end: Duration(milliseconds: 52347),
          text: 'Everyone turned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 52347),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 55978),
          text: 'His mother had given him the money for a school workbook.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 55978),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 61415),
          text:
              'He had placed it somewhere in his bag that morning, and now he could not find it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 61415),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 64394),
          text: 'The old reaction returned immediately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 64901),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 66423),
          text: '"Tariq was near that desk."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 66423),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 67742),
          text: '"I saw him pass by."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 67742),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 71394),
          text: '"Something always happens when he is around."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 71842),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 76922),
          text:
              'Sheikh Uncle stepped between the children and Tariq before the whispers could grow.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 76922),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 79642),
          text: '"Did anyone see Tariq take money?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 79642),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 80642),
          text: 'No.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 81642),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 84042),
          text: '"Did anyone see money in his hand?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 84042),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 85042),
          text: 'No.',
