          end: Duration(milliseconds: 133186),
          text: 'She opened it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 133186),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 137146),
          text: 'The five-hundred-rupee note had been used as a bookmark.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 137146),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 140106),
          text: 'For three seconds nobody spoke.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 140106),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 142946),
          text: 'Then Shahzaib covered his face.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 142946),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 144546),
          text: '"I remember now.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144546),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148466),
          text:
              'I was reading in the van and put it there so I would not lose it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 149228),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 150426),
          text: 'Akhlaaq stared at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 150426),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 151666),
          text: '"That plan needs improvement."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 151714),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 158175),
          text:
              'The class laughed, but Sheikh Uncle did not let the lesson disappear into humour.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 158714),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 160714),
          text: '"This is important.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 160714),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 162760),
          text: 'The money was never stolen.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 162760),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 168714),
          text:
              'Yet some minds were ready to produce a thief before we had even found the facts."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 168714),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 171168),
          text: 'Several students apologised to Tariq.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 172246),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 175178),
          text: 'He accepted, but he looked tired.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175178),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 180274),
          text: 'After school, Wasim sat beside him under the apple tree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 180274),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 186642),
          text:
              '"You know I would never believe something about you without proof."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 187226),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 189682),
          text: 'Tariq looked at him gratefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 189682),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 193306),
          text: '"You are the only person who keeps saying that."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 193306),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196854),
          text: '"Then perhaps you should trust me too."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 196854),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 205250),
          text:
              'The sentence sounded ordinary, but from a distance Imaan heard it and felt an uncomfortable thought.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 205250),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 209795),
          text: 'Wasim was becoming the person Tariq trusted most.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 209795),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 215378),
          text: 'That evening, Imaan and Akhlaaq opened their clue notebook.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 215378),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218898),
          text: 'They drew a line through the missing-money incident.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 218898),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 223618),
          text: '“Not connected,” Akhlaaq said, then stopped himself.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 223618),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 227298),
          text: '“Actually, that is stronger than what we know.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 227298),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 230618),
          text: 'We only know that we found no connection.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231018),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 231586),
          text: 'Imaan smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 231586),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 232396),
          text: '“Better.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 232396),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 236986),
          text: 'Honesty means correcting ourselves too.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 236986),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 240026),
          text: 'Their list now looked strange:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 240026),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 243306),
          text: 'The Book of Trust - still missing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 243306),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 245706),
          text: 'The note - writer unknown.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 245706),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 249643),
          text: 'Footprints - crescent-shaped gap in sole.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 250186),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 255061),
          text: 'Blue thread - smooth, shiny, now missing from office.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 255710),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 257918),
          text: 'Tariq\'s planter - explained.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 257918),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 260646),
          text: 'Donation key - accidental.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 260646),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 262594),
          text: 'Money - accidental.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263277),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 264757),
          text: 'Akhlaaq tapped the page.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 264757),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 267261),
          text: '"Some things are real clues.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 267261),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 269425),
          text: 'Some are distractions."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 269425),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 274522),
          text: '"And someone benefits every time people confuse the two."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 274522),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279522),
          text:
              'The next morning, Sheikh Uncle found something under his office door.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279522),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282522),
          text: 'Not another note.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282522),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 286522),
          text: 'A small piece of paper torn from a school timetable.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 286522),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 290522),
          text: 'On it, someone had written only four words:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 291490),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 293490),
          text: 'YOU ARE LOOKING WRONG.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 293490),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 297490),
          text: 'On the corner was a faint smudge of blue ink.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 297490),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 302490),
          text:
              'Beyond the boundary wall that evening, Haasid watched the last students leave.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 302490),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 307490),
          text: '“They are learning to say ‘I do not know’,” he muttered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 307490),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 310490),
          text: '“That makes rumours harder to feed.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 311458),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 312402),
          text: 'Kaazib gave a thin smile.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 312402),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 315897),
          text: '“Then give them something that looks certain.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 315897),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 320156),
          text: 'People often mistake a strong appearance for the truth.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 320156),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 323138),
          text: 'A third shadow beside them said nothing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 323138),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 331426),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day - Use "I Do Not Know"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 331426),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 342926),
          text:
              'Today, when you are unsure about an answer, event, rumour, or another person\'s intention, do not guess as though you are certain. Say, "I do not know," or "I am not sure," and stop there.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 342926),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 350188),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Catch yourself once before adding an unverified detail to a story and remove that detail.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
