        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 21400),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 22815),
          text: 'Wasim finding the watch.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 23381),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 30720),
          text:
              'Wasim always appearing near the centre of the mystery while looking like the person furthest from suspicion.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 30720),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 36883),
          text:
              'Before sleeping, Imaan had written WASIM alone at the top of a fresh page.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 37682),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 39671),
          text: 'Then she stared at the word.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 39671),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 42563),
          text: 'It looked like a verdict, not a question.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 43362),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 48084),
          text: 'She crossed it out and wrote instead: POSSIBLE CONNECTION.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 48084),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 56370),
          text:
              'By morning, Imaan had reached a more honest conclusion: she had a theory, but a theory was not proof.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 56370),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 59210),
          text: 'She showed Akhlaaq the crossed-out page.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 59210),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 63731),
          text:
              '“I wanted the clues to prove what I already believed,” she admitted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 63731),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 69999),
          text:
              '“If I hide doubts because I like my own theory, that is not honest investigation either.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 69999),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 73386),
          text: 'She still did not have enough proof.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 74086),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 74787),
          text: 'Akhlaaq agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 74787),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 81618),
          text:
              '"If we accuse Wasim because clues look suspicious, we would be doing exactly what everyone did to Tariq."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 82034),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 87909),
          text:
              'So they decided to watch, record and tell Sheikh Uncle only what they could support.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 87909),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 91332),
          text: 'That day Sheikh Uncle was away from the Academy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91332),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 95969),
          text:
              'The Islamiat teacher spent the afternoon sorting papers in his office.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 95969),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 101692),
          text:
              'She left her mobile phone on the desk while she returned to class for an attendance sheet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 101692),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104464),
          text: 'When she came back, the phone was gone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 104464),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 106866),
          text: 'She called it from the landline.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 106867),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 108546),
          text: 'Powered off.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 108546),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 111506),
          text: 'The news spread through the classroom within minutes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 111861),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 114275),
          text: 'Tariq had been out of the room collecting water.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 114834),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 118778),
          text: 'The familiar whispers began immediately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 118778),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 119342),
          text: '"Again?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 119342),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 120468),
          text: '"It is always Tariq."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 121032),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 122384),
          text: 'Wasim stood up.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 122384),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 122834),
          text: '"Stop.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 123474),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 127554),
          text:
              'He was outside the classroom, but that does not prove he entered the office."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 128412),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 129987),
          text: 'Imaan watched him carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 129987),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131293),
          text: 'His voice was calm.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 131293),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 136621),
          text:
              'His expression was exactly the one everyone expected from a loyal friend.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 136621),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 140147),
          text: 'The teacher searched the office and classroom.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 140147),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141470),
          text: 'Nothing appeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141470),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 144407),
          text: 'Then Shahzaib suggested checking bags.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144407),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 146160),
          text: 'The teacher hesitated.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 146160),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 151170),
          text:
              '"We will not search one child simply because people already suspect him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 151170),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 160810),
          text:
              'If bags must be checked, we follow the same rule for everyone, and each student stays present while his or her bag is opened."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 160811),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 165010),
          text: 'That corrected one unfairness from the past few days.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 165010),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 167010),
          text: 'The class agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 167010),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 169131),
          text: 'The search began row by row.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 169139),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 174638),
          text:
              'When it reached Tariq, he placed his bag on the desk with shaking hands.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 174639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 180638),
          text:
              'The teacher removed a textbook, a notebook, his pencil case and lunchbox.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 180639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 183139),
          text: 'Then she reached deeper.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 183139),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 185139),
          text: 'Her hand stopped.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 185139),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 188139),
          text: 'The missing mobile phone came out.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 189106),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 190986),
          text: 'Nobody breathed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 190986),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 195586),
          text:
              'Tariq stared at the phone as though it had appeared from another world.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 195586),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 197946),
          text: '"I did not put that there."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197947),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 201347),
          text: 'A boy whispered, "It was inside your bag."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 201347),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 203266),
          text: '"I did not take it!"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 203266),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 206346),
          text: 'The room exploded into voices.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 206347),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 209074),
          text: 'Wasim stood frozen for several seconds.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 209074),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 213275),
          text: 'Then his face changed into hurt disbelief.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 213275),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 214123),
          text: '"Tariq...',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 214123),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 217094),
          text: 'I defended you every time."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 217094),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218568),
          text: '"Wasim, please.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 218568),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 219775),
          text: 'You know me."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 219775),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 222474),
          text: '"I thought I did."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 222474),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 225914),
          text: 'Those words hurt more than the accusations.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 225914),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 228955),
          text: 'The teacher raised her voice for silence.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 229210),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 237322),
          text:
              'She did not call Tariq a thief, but the phone was serious evidence and Sheikh Uncle would have to investigate.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 237322),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 243443),
          text:
              'Tariq was asked to remain home the next day until the matter could be reviewed properly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 243443),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 246242),
          text: 'No child was allowed to insult him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 246242),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 253090),
          text:
              'Still, Tariq left the Academy feeling as though the walls themselves had rejected him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 253447),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 255410),
          text: 'Imaan and Akhlaaq remained behind.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 256610),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 260650),
          text:
              '"The phone being in his bag is evidence," Akhlaaq said quietly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 261690),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 265890),
          text: '"Evidence that it was in his bag," Imaan replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 265891),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 268770),
          text: '"Not evidence of how it got there."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 268771),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270746),
          text: 'They both looked toward Wasim.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 271298),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 277498),
          text:
              'He was speaking to the teacher with tears in his eyes, saying he felt foolish for trusting Tariq.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 277498),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 280308),
          text: 'His performance was perfect.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 280308),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282299),
          text: 'Perhaps too perfect.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282708),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 286498),
          text: 'Imaan opened her clue notebook and added the phone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 286498),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 292525),
          text:
              'Then Akhlaaq noticed something beside Tariq\'s desk: a tiny smear of damp soil.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 292525),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 295506),
          text: '"His shoes are dry," he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 295863),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 297736),
          text: 'Imaan looked down the corridor.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 298271),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 299431),
          text: 'Wasim\'s shoes were not.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 299431),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 304698),
          text:
              'Before they could examine anything further, he picked up his bag and left.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 304698),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 309461),
          text:
              'The small black device above the corridor door blinked red once.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 310418),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 311786),
          text: 'Akhlaaq stared at it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 311786),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 312469),
          text: '"Imaan..."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 312469),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 313153),
          text: '"I know."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 313153),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 319906),
          text:
              'For the first time, the mystery was no longer asking only who had lied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 319906),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 324394),
          text: 'It was asking whether the truth had been watching all along.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 325553),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 331802),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day - Return What Is Not Yours',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 331802),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 344122),
          text:
              'If you find something that does not belong to you today, do not keep it, hide it, or treat it as a lucky find. Return it to the owner or hand it to a responsible adult.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 344122),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 355004),
          text:
              'Level-Up: If you borrowed something and have delayed returning it, return it today in the condition you received it - or explain honestly if it was damaged.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
