          text:
              'It is less exciting than guessing, but it causes fewer disasters."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 71371),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 73550),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle returned after the first lesson.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 75143),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 76758),
          text: '“Assalam o Alaikum,” he greeted the class.',
