        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 76758),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 81558),
          text: '“Wa Alaikum Assalam,” they replied, more quietly than usual.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 81558),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 85878),
          text: 'He listened to the teacher’s report without interruption.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 85878),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 93678),
          text:
              'He asked exactly what had been seen, exactly how the bags had been searched, and exactly who had been present.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 93686),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 99326),
          text: 'Then Imaan and Akhlaaq asked to speak with him privately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 99326),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 102086),
          text: 'They did not say, "Wasim did it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 102086),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104926),
          text: 'They showed him their observations.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 104926),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 110886),
          text:
              'The blue clue had been smooth like a lanyard, not rough like Tariq\'s bag.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 110886),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 116814),
          text:
              'The shoeprint at the Adventure Park had the same crescent-shaped gap as the garden print.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 116814),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 120894),
          text: 'Wasim\'s right shoe appeared to have a matching gap.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 120894),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 123374),
          text: 'His blue lanyard was frayed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 123374),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 126234),
          text: 'He had found the watch in the trees.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 126234),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 132834),
          text:
              'He had repeatedly known details early, although each detail had an innocent explanation by itself.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 134004),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 136982),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle listened without praising their theory.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 136982),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 142782),
          text:
              '"Good investigation does not mean falling in love with your own answer," he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 142782),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 144882),
          text: '"Now we test it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144882),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 150462),
          text:
              'He took them into the office and pointed toward the small black device above the corridor.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 151494),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153262),
          text: 'Akhlaaq\'s eyes widened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 153262),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 154590),
          text: '"It is a camera."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 154590),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 162230),
          text:
              '"After the first theft, I installed cameras in the office corridor and several common areas," Sheikh Uncle explained.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 162230),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 164710),
          text: '"Not inside private spaces, of course.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 164710),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 171510),
          text:
              'I did not announce them because I wanted to protect the Academy without turning every child into a suspect."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171510),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 172510),
          text: '"Do they record?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 173050),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 173558),
          text: 'Imaan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 173558),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 173804),
          text: '"Yes."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 174214),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 183678),
          text:
              'Sheikh Uncle had not reviewed every hour because the earlier incidents had seemed uncertain and he wanted to avoid treating children like criminals.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 183678),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 186598),
          text: 'But the planted phone changed the situation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 186598),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 189438),
          text: 'They began with the time the phone disappeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 189438),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 192518),
          text: 'The recording showed the teacher leaving the office.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 192518),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 193518),
          text: 'The room remained empty.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 193526),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 195526),
          text: 'Then someone entered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 195869),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 198526),
          text: 'Imaan\'s hand tightened around her notebook.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 198526),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 200526),
          text: 'The figure stepped toward the desk.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 200526),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 204526),
          text: 'Before the face became clear, Sheikh Uncle paused the video.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 204526),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 205009),
          text: '"Imaan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 205009),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 205491),
          text: 'Akhlaaq.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 205491),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 209526),
          text: 'This is the moment when detectives can become careless.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 209526),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 210526),
          text: 'What do we know?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 211251),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 213494),
          text: 'Akhlaaq stared at the frozen image.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 213494),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 214684),
          text: '"Someone entered."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 214684),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 215704),
          text: '"Anything else?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 215704),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 216214),
          text: '"Not yet."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 216214),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 219011),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle nodded and pressed play.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 219011),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 221808),
          text: 'The person moved into the light.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 221808),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 224605),
          text: 'A blue lanyard crossed his chest.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224605),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 225072),
          text: 'Wasim.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 225072),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 226004),
          text: 'Nobody spoke.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226004),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 233462),
          text:
              'He picked up the teacher\'s phone, switched it off, and placed it in his pocket.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 233462),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 235287),
          text: 'The video continued.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 235287),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 240224),
          text: 'A second camera showed him standing near the classroom.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 240224),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 248617),
          text:
              'He called Tariq toward the water area, waited until Tariq stepped inside to wash his hands, then opened Tariq\'s bag.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 248617),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 251583),
          text: 'The phone disappeared inside.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 252295),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 255430),
          text: 'Akhlaaq whispered, "He planted it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 255870),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 258943),
          text: 'Imaan felt no excitement at being right.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 258943),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 260150),
          text: 'Only sadness.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 260150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 264150),
          text: '"We have more recordings," Sheikh Uncle said quietly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 264150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 267590),
          text: '"We will review them before speaking to the class."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 267590),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 271950),
          text:
              'The next clip was from the day of the missing blue-thread envelope.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 271950),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 275398),
          text: 'Wasim entered the office after everyone had gone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 275398),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 277398),
          text: 'He opened the drawer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 277398),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279398),
          text: 'And removed the clue.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279398),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282398),
          text: 'The mystery had finally produced an answer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282398),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 285398),
          text: 'But it had also produced a worse question.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 285398),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 288398),
          text: 'If Wasim had been creating the evidence...',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 289155),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 295366),
          text:
              'what had he done on the very first day, before the cameras were installed?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 295366),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 313334),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day - Repair One Unfair Judgment',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 313334),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 316679),
          text:
              'If you have spoken unfairly about someone, laughed at their embarrassment, or repeated a suspicion, correct one thing today. Apologise or tell the people who heard you that you did not have enough evidence.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 316679),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 326732),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Do one respectful act toward someone who is being left out or judged by others, without making a public show of rescuing them.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'honesty_en_09',
      title: 'Ep 9 · The Truth on the Screen',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/honesty.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/honesty/09_the_truth_on_the_screen.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.moral,
      description: 'The Book of Trust — episode 9 of 10.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 203),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1720),
          text: 'CHAPTER 9',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1720),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 5323),
          text: 'The Truth on the Screen',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 5323),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 12571),
          text:
              'Moral Focus: Honesty is what remains when the performance is removed',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 12571),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 18571),
          text:
              'The next morning, Sheikh Uncle\'s Academy felt like a room holding its breath.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 18976),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 20111),
          text: 'Tariq was still at home.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 20111),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 24571),
          text:
              'Wasim had returned, unaware that the recordings had been reviewed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 24571),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 31819),
          text:
              'Before the first lesson, Sheikh Uncle asked him to wait in the office with another teacher while the class gathered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 31819),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 34859),
          text: 'Then he placed the laptop on the front desk.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 34859),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 42019),
          text:
              '"Yesterday," he began, "many of you believed the matter was settled because the phone was found inside Tariq\'s bag.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 42019),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 47411),
          text:
              'Today we are going to learn why evidence must be understood, not merely seen."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 47411),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 49219),
          text: 'He played the recording.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 49219),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 56239),
          text:
              'The class watched Wasim enter the office, take the phone and later place it inside Tariq\'s bag.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 56239),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 58364),
          text: 'Shock moved across the room.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 58364),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 62191),
          text: 'The same child who had defended Tariq had framed him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 62191),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 64356),
          text: 'The teacher covered her mouth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 64356),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 66347),
          text: '"I praised him for being fair."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 66951),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72955),
          text:
              'Sheikh Uncle replied gently, "You praised the behaviour you believed you were seeing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 72955),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 79275),
          text:
              'That is why dishonesty is so destructive: it uses other people\'s trust as part of the lie."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 79275),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 85555),
          text:
              'He played the second recording showing Wasim removing the blue-thread clue from the office.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 85555),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 87723),
          text: 'Then he showed a clip from the field-trip return.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 88363),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 95619),
          text:
              'The Adventure Park camera system had provided one relevant recording after Sheikh Uncle contacted them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 95619),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104366),
          text:
              'It showed Wasim near the picnic table, slipping the watch into his pocket while others were distracted, then walking toward the trees before later "finding" it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 104366),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 107411),
          text: 'The students were stunned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 107982),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 110411),
          text: 'Imaan opened her notebook.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 110411),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 112411),
          text: '"The crescent footprint."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 112723),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 113411),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 113411),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 122411),
          text:
              'The shape of Wasim\'s damaged shoe sole matched the repeated prints closely enough to explain why the same mark had appeared in both places.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 122411),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 124257),
          text: '"And the blue thread?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 124834),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 125411),
          text: 'Akhlaaq asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 126379),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 129339),
          text: '"We have not guessed," Sheikh Uncle said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 129339),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 133259),
          text:
              '"We inspected Wasim\'s lanyard this morning with his parent present.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 133259),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 137419),
          text:
              'The fibre type matches the thread that was found near my drawer."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 137419),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141939),
          text:
              'Piece by piece, the false picture around Tariq began to collapse.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141939),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145419),
          text: 'But Sheikh Uncle turned the lesson toward the class as well.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 145539),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148147),
          text: '"Wasim is responsible for what he did.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148147),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 151467),
          text: 'Yet many of us made another mistake.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 151467),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 160787),
          text:
              'Once we began believing Tariq was dishonest, every nervous look became \'proof.\' Every coincidence became part of the same story.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 160787),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 164627),
          text: 'We stopped asking what else could explain what we saw."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 165267),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 166315),
          text: 'Shahzaib lowered his head.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 166315),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 168315),
          text: '"I made jokes about him."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 168315),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 172715),
          text:
              'Another child said, "I called him a thief without seeing him steal."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 172715),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 176315),
          text: '"And I stopped sitting beside him," someone else admitted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 176743),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 179315),
          text: 'Imaan looked at Tariq\'s empty chair.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 179315),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 182315),
          text: '"We cannot undo those days for him."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 182315),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 184315),
          text: '"No," Sheikh Uncle said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 184315),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 187283),
          text: '"But we can repair what can be repaired."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 187283),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 190963),
          text: 'Then Akhlaaq asked the final question.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 190963),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 193283),
          text: '"What about the Book of Trust?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 193283),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196483),
          text: 'The cameras were installed after it disappeared."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197571),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 199203),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle closed the laptop.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 199203),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 202003),
          text: '"That part cannot be answered by a recording.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 202003),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 203883),
          text: 'It requires something else."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 203883),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 204883),
          text: '"What?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 204883),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 205643),
          text: '"A confession."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 206251),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 210091),
          text:
              'He brought Wasim into the classroom with the second teacher present.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 210944),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 212651),
          text: 'Wasim\'s face was pale.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 212651),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218331),
          text:
              'He had already seen enough of the footage in the office to know that pretending would not help him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 218947),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 223051),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle placed the original white note on the desk.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 223051),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 225691),
          text: 'THE TRUTH LEAVES FOOTPRINTS.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 225691),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 226027),
          text: 'FOLLOW THEM.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226219),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 228219),
          text: '"Did you write this?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 228969),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 230219),
          text: 'Wasim stared at it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 230219),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 234219),
          text: 'For several seconds, the class heard only the clock.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 234219),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 237219),
          text: 'Then he whispered, "Yes."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 237219),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 239219),
          text: '"Did you take the Book of Trust?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 240166),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 242219),
          text: 'Wasim closed his eyes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 242219),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 243219),
          text: '"Yes."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 243219),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 246187),
          text: 'A quiet shock passed through the students.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 246187),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 253187),
          text:
              'He admitted that he had hidden the notebook in the old sports-storage cupboard behind the equipment room.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 253187),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 262187),
          text:
              'He had written the note to make the disappearance feel like a mystery and to guide attention toward the garden, where Tariq often walked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 262187),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 268092),
          text:
              'The blue thread had torn from his lanyard when he opened Sheikh Uncle\'s drawer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 268092),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 273555),
          text:
              'When it was later protected as evidence, he returned and removed it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 273555),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 274778),
          text: '"Why Tariq?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 275390),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 276155),
          text: 'Imaan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 276155),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 278519),
          text: 'Wasim looked toward the floor.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 278519),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282679),
          text: '"Because everyone trusted him before they trusted me.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282679),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 284982),
          text: 'Teachers praised him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 284982),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 287126),
          text: 'Younger students asked him for help.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 287126),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 290136),
          text: 'I wanted people to look at me instead."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 290136),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 292443),
          text: 'He admitted something else.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 292919),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 299483),
          text:
              'Haasid had fed that jealousy, and Kaazib had encouraged every excuse and lie that followed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 300443),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 302945),
          text: 'But Wasim did not blame them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 302945),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 305883),
          text: '"They did not move my hands," he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 306091),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 308091),
          text: '"I chose to listen.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 308091),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 310091),
          text: 'I chose every lie."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 310091),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 317091),
          text:
              'That was the first completely honest sentence he had spoken about the mystery.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 317579),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 321091),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle sent a teacher to the sports cupboard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 321091),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 325091),
          text: 'Minutes later she returned carrying the brown notebook.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 326059),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 329963),
          text: '“Alhamdulillah,” Sheikh Uncle said softly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 329963),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 333179),
          text: 'The Book of Trust was finally back.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 333179),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 346019),
          text: 'Its blue ribbon was torn.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 346019),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 346027),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day - Hidden Honesty',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 346027),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 357147),
          text:
              'Do one honest action today that nobody needs to praise you for: return extra money, correct a score, admit you caused a mess, refuse an unfair advantage, or keep a promise when nobody is checking.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 357147),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 365073),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Do not tell anyone about the action afterward unless telling them is necessary to repair something.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
