          text:
              'Moral Focus: Truth, accountability, forgiveness and rebuilding trust',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 13322),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 20602),
          text:
              'The next morning, Tariq stood outside Sheikh Uncle\'s Academy and could not make himself open the gate.',
        ),
