          text:
              'Before leaving, she reminded him of a Qur’anic command: be mindful of Allah and be with the truthful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 31690),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 36894),
          text:
              '“You cannot control what people believed yesterday,” she told him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 36894),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 40858),
          text: '“You can control the truth you bring with you today.',
        ),
