          end: Duration(milliseconds: 44938),
          text:
              'Walk in with honesty, and what can be repaired will be repaired, Inn shaa Allah.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 44938),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 47474),
          text: 'Tariq finally stepped inside.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 47474),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 50010),
          text: 'The Academy felt different.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 50010),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 58887),
          text:
              'Children who had once looked away now seemed unsure how to meet his eyes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 58887),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 63325),
          text: 'Imaan and Akhlaaq came to him first.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 63325),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 64366),
          text: '“Assalam o Alaikum, Tariq,” Imaan said gently.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 64366),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 67246),
          text: '“Wa Alaikum Assalam,” he replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 67246),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 69486),
          text: '“Sit with us,” Akhlaaq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 69486),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72246),
          text: '“You should hear everything properly.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 72246),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 74566),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle gathered the class.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 74566),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 78966),
          text: 'Wasim sat at the front with his parents and another teacher.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 78966),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 84714),
          text:
              'The brown Book of Trust rested on the desk, its damaged ribbon carefully tied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 85129),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 90194),
          text:
              'Sheikh Uncle explained what the cameras had shown and what Wasim had confessed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 92263),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 94794),
          text: 'Tariq listened without interrupting.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 94794),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 97840),
          text: 'When the explanation ended, he looked at Wasim.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 98394),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 99994),
          text: '"You were the one?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 100762),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 101602),
          text: 'Wasim nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 101602),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 102022),
          text: '"Yes."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 102722),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104682),
          text: 'Tariq\'s voice was quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 104682),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 109022),
          text: '"You sat with me when nobody else would."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 109022),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 109722),
          text: '"I know."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 109722),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 111543),
          text: '"You told me not to worry."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 111543),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 112022),
          text: '"I know."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 112022),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 117542),
          text:
              '"You made me trust you while you were making everyone distrust me."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 117542),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 119642),
          text: 'Wasim began to cry.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 119642),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 120762),
          text: '"I am sorry."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 121209),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 122933),
          text: 'Tariq did not rush to hug him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 122933),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 129870),
          text:
              'He did not pretend that a painful betrayal had vanished because two words were spoken.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 129870),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 133693),
          text: '"I accept that you are apologising," Tariq said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 133693),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 135692),
          text: '"But what you did hurt me.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 135692),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 137751),
          text: 'Trust will take time."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 137751),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 139810),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 140698),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 142778),
          text: '"That is an honest answer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 142778),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 147658),
          text:
              'Forgiveness and rebuilding trust are not always the same process."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148248),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 150778),
          text: 'Wasim\'s parents had already been informed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 150778),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 160538),
          text:
              'He would be suspended from the Academy for a period, return the damaged property, write a full account of what he had done, and apologise to the people he had deceived.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 160666),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 168822),
          text:
              'Before any return, Sheikh Uncle would meet with him and his family to make a plan for rebuilding trust through consistent behaviour.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 169446),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 172786),
          text: '"Consequences are necessary," Sheikh Uncle said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 172786),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 180634),
          text:
              '"But a consequence should point a person toward responsibility, not turn the whole community into a crowd that enjoys punishment."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 180634),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 183070),
          text: 'No one laughed at Wasim.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 183070),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 185891),
          text: 'No one clapped when he left.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 185891),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 189994),
          text: 'Then the students faced their own part.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 190646),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 191514),
          text: 'Shahzaib was first.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 192057),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196726),
          text: '"Tariq, I made jokes about you when you were already hurting.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 196726),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 197594),
          text: 'I am sorry."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197594),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 208452),
          text:
              'One by one, others apologised for repeating rumours, moving their bags away, refusing to sit with him, or speaking as if suspicion were proof.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 209033),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 209962),
          text: 'Tariq listened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 209962),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 212169),
          text: '"I was angry," he admitted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 212169),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 213562),
          text: '"I am still hurt.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 213562),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 218382),
          text:
              'But I do not want to become cruel because people were cruel to me.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 218382),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 219402),
          text: 'I forgive you.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 220570),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 226570),
          text:
              'Just... next time, do not decide a person\'s whole character from one suspicious moment."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226976),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 230530),
          text: 'Imaan opened the clue notebook and smiled sadly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 230530),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 232610),
          text: '"We learned that the hard way."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 233212),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 239930),
          text:
              'Akhlaaq added, "We also learned that looking honest and being honest are not the same thing."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 239930),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 239931),
          text:
              'Sheikh Uncle opened the recovered Book of Trust to the first blank page.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 239931),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 243970),
          text: '"This book was supposed to collect honest choices.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 243970),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 248338),
          text: 'Perhaps the mystery has given us our first entries."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 248338),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 249929),
          text: 'He handed the pen to Tariq.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 250923),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 253806),
          text: 'Tariq thought for a while before writing:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 253806),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 257472),
          text: 'I told the truth even when nobody believed me.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 257868),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 259252),
          text: 'Imaan wrote beneath it:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 259252),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 263046),
          text: 'I learned not to turn suspicion into a fact.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 263685),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 264218),
          text: 'Akhlaaq added:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 264218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 269866),
          text:
              'I learned that \'I don\'t know\' can be more honest than a clever answer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270693),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 272346),
          text: 'Shahzaib took the pen next.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 272346),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 276086),
          text: 'He stared at the page longer than anyone expected.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 276086),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 276991),
          text: 'Then he wrote:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 276991),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 284354),
          text:
              'I learned that a joke can become dishonest when it humiliates someone with a story I cannot prove.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 284354),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 286694),
          text: 'The class became quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 286694),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 289274),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle looked at the page and nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 290174),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 291074),
          text: '“Mashaa Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 291074),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 295034),
          text: 'These are honest reflections, not just clever answers.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 295034),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 298574),
          text: 'Finally, Sheikh Uncle left one line blank.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 298574),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 299449),
          text: '"For Wasim?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 299887),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 300434),
          text: 'Imaan asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 300442),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 301599),
          text: '“Perhaps,” he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 301599),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 305601),
          text: '“Not because the book should pretend nothing happened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 305601),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 312602),
          text:
              'Because if he truly changes, Inn shaa Allah, honesty should have somewhere to begin again.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 312602),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 315936),
          text: 'That afternoon, Tariq visited Mohsin and Mohsina.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 316542),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 320202),
          text:
              'He still had the watermelon seed they had given him weeks earlier.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 320410),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 324650),
          text: '"I think I understand it now," he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 325105),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 325650),
          text: 'Mohsin smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 325650),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 326650),
          text: '"Tell us."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 326650),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 330650),
          text: '"Truth did not become false when nobody believed me.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 330650),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 333331),
          text: 'It was still true underground, like a seed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 333331),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 337170),
          text: 'But it needed patience before people could see it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 337859),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 338450),
          text: 'Mohsina nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 338450),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 340378),
          text: '"And what will you do with the seed?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 340378),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 344863),
          text:
              'Tariq looked toward the small patch of soil beside their wall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 344863),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 345478),
          text: '"Plant it."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 345478),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 348489),
          text: 'Together they pressed it into the earth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 348489),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 353960),
          text:
              'Back at Sheikh Uncle\'s Academy, the brown Book of Trust sat safely on the desk.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 353960),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 356798),
          text: 'The torn blue ribbon was still visible.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 357307),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 359748),
          text: 'Sheikh Uncle chose not to replace it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 359748),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 363748),
          text: 'The damaged ribbon had become part of the lesson.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 363748),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 365219),
          text: 'Trust could be torn.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 365219),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 367426),
          text: 'Reputation could be damaged.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 367426),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 373221),
          text:
              'A lie could make an innocent person look guilty and a dishonest person look admirable.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 373221),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 377421),
          text: 'But truth had one strength deception could never possess:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 377421),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 380314),
          text: 'It did not need to remain hidden forever.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 380314),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 387314),
          text:
              'And from that week onward, the children no longer asked only, "Does this look true?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 387314),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 390751),
          text: 'They learned to ask the harder question:',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 390751),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 392834),
          text: '"What do we actually know?"',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 392834),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 397354),
          text: 'That was how the Book of Trust finally began.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 397354),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 400234),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day - Rebuild Trust With Action',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 400282),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 417282),
          text:
              'Choose one relationship where your actions have weakened trust. Do one concrete repair today: apologise without excuses, return what you owe, complete a promise, correct a lie, or show up for a responsibility you have avoided.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 417282),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 427910),
          text:
              'Level-Up: Repeat the repaired behaviour consistently for the next three opportunities. Trust is rebuilt by patterns, not one dramatic apology.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 427910),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 433295),
          text: 'Islamic Reference Notes for the Editor / Parent',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 433295),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 440218),
          text:
              'Truthfulness leads to righteousness and righteousness leads to Paradise.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 440218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 446218),
          text: 'Sahih al-Bukhari 6094; Sahih Muslim 2607.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 446218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 449218),
          text: 'Avoiding suspicion and fault-finding.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 449218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 452218),
          text: 'Qur\'an 49:12.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 452218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 455218),
          text: '"Whoever deceives us is not one of us."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 455218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 458218),
          text: 'Sahih Muslim 102.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 458218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 463526),
          text:
              'A Muslim is one from whose tongue and hand other Muslims are safe.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 463526),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 467986),
          text: 'Sahih al-Bukhari 10; Sahih Muslim 40.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 467986),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 470946),
          text: '"Speak good or remain silent."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 470946),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 476466),
          text: 'Sahih al-Bukhari 6018; Sahih Muslim 47.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 476466),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 478906),
          text: '"Be with those who are truthful."',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 480154),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 481154),
          text: 'Qur\'an 9:119.',
        ),
      ],
    ),
  ],
);
